//
// What Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab read off animage.exe itself. The
// window icon is set separately, from the PNGs in icons/, because a running
// window asks Qt for its icon and never looks at the executable.
//
// The name has to sort first among the icon resources for the shell to treat
// it as the application's: it takes the lowest-numbered one. There is only one
// here, and 1 keeps it that way if another is ever added.
1 ICON "animage.ico"
